  "contentHtml": "<p>구글 제미나이로&#160;</p><p>&#39;혈액순환 과정 시뮬레이션&#39;을 만들어보았습니다.</p><p>(무료 버젼을 사용하여 2일간 만들었습니다~)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>작성한 프롬프트는</p><p>아래와 같습니다.</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 53.9599%; height: 232px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 71px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 71px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7aa645c3e1fc64d378711c30bcda19e3facb9dee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7aa645c3e1fc64d378711c30bcda19e3facb9dee\" data-origin-width=\"320\" data-origin-height=\"56\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 89px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 89px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a3e9bb044c399a7fa1134ef44a8a6a1a9f6c3f2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a3e9bb044c399a7fa1134ef44a8a6a1a9f6c3f2\" data-origin-width=\"221\" data-origin-height=\"46\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 18px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67aaf3f448a3a8d833a2105a69033bd3f9bb55f1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/67aaf3f448a3a8d833a2105a69033bd3f9bb55f1\" data-origin-width=\"346\" data-origin-height=\"92\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 18px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9325ff7676008f5ac131c9486c11f3655109f8c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9325ff7676008f5ac131c9486c11f3655109f8c7\" data-origin-width=\"325\" data-origin-height=\"45\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 18px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a30f229032742b7f269e8cac4bc921899edf9b3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a30f229032742b7f269e8cac4bc921899edf9b3\" data-origin-width=\"360\" data-origin-height=\"334\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 18px;\"><td style=\"width: 100%; height: 18px;\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&lt;시뮬레이션 완성작품&gt;</span></b></p><p><a href=\"https://g.co/gemini/share/32cb288ce04e\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://g.co/gemini/share/32cb288ce04e</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>인터넷 화면을 축소해서 보시면&#160;(70% 이하)</p><p>전체 작품이 잘 보입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>* 더 수정하고 싶은 것들</p><p>1. 우심방과 좌심방이 동시에 수축하고, 좌심실과 우심실에 동시에 수축하는 모습 표현하기</p><p><a href=\"https://i.gifer.com/2qRM.gif\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://i.gifer.com/2qRM.gif</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 자막 설명과 혈액의 이동을 일치하게 하기</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>(수업 활용 방법)</p><p>방법1. 시뮬레이션을 재생하고, 각 부위의 명칭과 혈액의 이동과정을 설명하기</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
